      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.271,
          "end": 3.4,
          "en": "[Maximilian Shwarzmuller] Now let's continue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.4,
          "end": 5.563,
          "en": "with improving this app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.46,
          "end": 9.26,
          "en": "If we move on to the next screen here on Android,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.26,
          "end": 10.913,
          "en": "we notice a new problem.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.91,
          "end": 16.7,
          "en": "In landscape mode, there isn't enough space available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.7,
          "end": 19.91,
          "en": "Even here on iOS it's not really that great.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.91,
          "end": 22.79,
          "en": "It would be usable there but it doesn't look good",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.79,
          "end": 25.98,
          "en": "and on Android on this device here to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.98,
          "end": 28.91,
          "en": "it's not really usable in landscape mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.91,
          "end": 32.01,
          "en": "Sure we can always switch back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.01,
          "end": 34.95,
          "en": "and that should theoretically work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.95,
          "end": 39.22,
          "en": "It does work here on iOS and it should be a problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.22,
          "end": 42.28,
          "en": "with the simulator here on Android because theoretically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.28,
          "end": 44.81,
          "en": "we should be able to switch here as well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.81,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "but either way, the problem is that it should also work well",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.913,
          "en": "in landscape mode and that is not happening at the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.83,
          "end": 54.79,
          "en": "So how could we improve this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.79,
          "end": 57.85,
          "en": "There are certainly many ways of improving this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.85,
          "end": 60.22,
          "en": "but I wanna dive in one specific way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.22,
          "end": 65.22,
          "en": "I wanna totally change this UI or at least parts of this UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.63,
          "end": 68.13,
          "en": "when we are in landscape mode",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.13,
          "end": 72.837,
          "en": "or when we have more width but less height available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.763,
          "end": 76.41,
          "en": "And we can achieve this pretty easily",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.41,
          "end": 78.36,
          "en": "with the Dimensions API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.36,
          "end": 81.22,
          "en": "but now we're using it for a brand new concept",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.22,
          "end": 84.24,
          "en": "to dynamically adjust the layout structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.24,
          "end": 85.943,
          "en": "and the component structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.75,
          "end": 91.37,
          "en": "For this here, in the GameScreen, that is our UI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 91.37,
          "end": 94.56,
          "en": "as we display it when everything is normal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 94.56,
          "end": 96.023,
          "en": "so in portrait mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 97.15,
          "end": 99.8,
          "en": "Now what I want to do, is I wanna change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99.8,
          "end": 103.36,
          "en": "I wanna render a different UI in landscape mode.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 103.36,
          "end": 106.22999999999999,
          "en": "For that we can use the Dimensions API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 106.22999999999999,
          "end": 109.55,
          "en": "and I wanna use it such that we can listen to changes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.55,
          "end": 113.42,
          "en": "in the dimensions inside our component function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.42,
          "end": 115.06,
          "en": "So therefore, I wanna use this hook,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.06,
          "end": 117.77000000000001,
          "en": "the useWindowDimensions hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.77000000000001,
          "end": 120.49,
          "en": "And then as you learned, we can use that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.49,
          "end": 122.86,
          "en": "in our component function in the GameScreen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 122.86,
          "end": 125.8,
          "en": "we can call useWindowDimensions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 125.8,
          "end": 130.62,
          "en": "and then we can get our width and height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.62,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "And you don't need to always get both, you can of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 136.82,
          "en": "just get the one value you might be interested in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.82,
          "end": 138.57,
          "en": "Here I'm just getting both to show you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.57,
          "end": 142.28,
          "en": "that both properties exist on this object returned",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.28,
          "end": 144.61,
          "en": "by useWindowDimensions.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.61,
          "end": 145.94,
          "en": "Now I just wanna find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 145.94,
          "end": 148.41,
          "en": "if we have plenty of width available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 148.41,
          "end": 152.48,
          "en": "in which case I wanna display a layout that is optimized",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.48,
          "end": 153.873,
          "en": "for more width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 154.76,
          "end": 159.5,
          "en": "So therefore, maybe down here, right before we return JSX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.5,
          "end": 162.773,
          "en": "I in the end want to create a variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.81,
          "end": 166.29,
          "en": "content could be the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.29,
          "end": 171.22,
          "en": "and that content should be the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.22,
          "end": 173.49,
          "en": "that should be rendered by default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.49,
          "end": 176.88,
          "en": "So that could be this NumberContainer with the card below it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.9,
          "end": 180.793,
          "en": "like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 182.4,
          "end": 184.9,
          "en": "Therefore, I'll cut this from here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.9,
          "end": 187.99,
          "en": "and then add this between those fragment tags here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 189.923,
          "en": "like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.27,
          "end": 192.92,
          "en": "I used these fragment tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.92,
          "end": 196.17000000000002,
          "en": "since I have two root components next to each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.17000000000002,
          "end": 199.76,
          "en": "card and number container are root sibling components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 199.76,
          "end": 203.61,
          "en": "and this would not be allowed without such a fragment tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 203.61,
          "end": 206.91,
          "en": "Now that is my default layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.91,
          "end": 210.34,
          "en": "and therefore I'll inject this content variable here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.34,
          "end": 212.313,
          "en": "below the title, above the view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.19,
          "end": 215.81,
          "en": "With that alone, nothing changes of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 215.81,
          "end": 217.883,
          "en": "we got the same look and feel as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.97,
          "end": 220.93,
          "en": "But now I do want to change the layout,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.93,
          "end": 223.77,
          "en": "if we have more width available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.77,
          "end": 226.18,
          "en": "And for this we could add a if statement here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 226.18,
          "end": 229.41,
          "en": "and check if width is maybe greater than",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 229.41,
          "end": 233.893,
          "en": "let's say 500 or 600, you can play around with that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 235.04,
          "end": 237.84,
          "en": "If we have that much width available,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.84,
          "end": 242.13,
          "en": "then we are likely in landscape mode but even if we're not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 242.13,
          "end": 245.04,
          "en": "then I wanna display my UI differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 245.04,
          "end": 248.31,
          "en": "Then my content, which will be output down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.31,
          "end": 252.37,
          "en": "is not this NumberContainer with the card next to it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 252.37,
          "end": 255.61,
          "en": "instead I then wanna have my NumberContainer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.61,
          "end": 259.55,
          "en": "but to the left and right of that, I wanna have my buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.55,
          "end": 261.65,
          "en": "and above the NumberContainer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261.65,
          "end": 265.42,
          "en": "I wanna have this higher or lower text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.42,
          "end": 270.42,
          "en": "So actually here, I will also add the fragment tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 273,
          "end": 275.47,
          "en": "but now above the NumberContainer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 275.47,
          "end": 277.883,
          "en": "I will have the instruction text here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 278.75,
          "end": 280.46,
          "en": "So copy this down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 281.85,
          "end": 284.26,
          "en": "and then left and right of the NumberContainer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 284.26,
          "end": 285.56,
          "en": "I wanna have my buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 285.56,
          "end": 289.14,
          "en": "therefore I will wrap this in a view overall.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.14,
          "end": 294.14,
          "en": "And in that view, I then add these two buttons here.",
