          "en": "you can render two totally different user interfaces",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 393.81,
          "end": 397.47,
          "en": "or layouts with different content based on the width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 397.47,
          "end": 398.633,
          "en": "as we're doing it here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 400.09000000000003,
          "end": 403.77,
          "en": "So now this is gone and now the log is a bit more accessible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 403.77,
          "end": 405.033,
          "en": "and easier to see.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 405.98,
          "end": 408.39,
          "en": "We might also want to reduce the spacing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 408.39,
          "end": 413.03,
          "en": "around this container and the spacing above the log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 415.96,
          "end": 419.02,
          "en": "and therefore on this listContainer that holds the log,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 419.02,
          "end": 421.36,
          "en": "we could, for example, adjust the padding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 421.36,
          "end": 424.7,
          "en": "so that there is less padding around the log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 424.7,
          "end": 427.743,
          "en": "or at least reduce the padding to top and bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 430.01,
          "end": 433.78,
          "en": "Alternatively, in the number container, we could of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 433.78,
          "end": 436.74,
          "en": "tweak the margin so that there is less space",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 436.74,
          "end": 439.223,
          "en": "around the NumberContainer that will be reserved.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
